            "review_text": "clogs23\nNottingham, United Kingdom146 contributions\n0\nI wanted to love it\nAug 2025 • Couples\nI so wanted to love this place but sadly the food was just lacking taste. \n\nThe person who served us was lovely.\nThe decor was really nice.\nThe menu was varied. \n\nBut the taste just didn't impress us at all and it all felt a bit lacklustre. \n\nWe had:\n- Sesame Tofu Bites (silken tofu so texture wasnt great). The dipping sauce was my favourite part of the meal. \n- Some sort of curry. They warned us it was spicy but lacked flavour.\n- Vietnamese Pancake\nRead more\nWritten August 10, 2025",
