            "review_title": "Review at Heal and Celeb Vegan Restaurant Thuan Chay",
            "review_text": "Ginny N\n3 contributions\n0\nHealthy, Yummy, and So Aesthetic\nJul 2025 • Family\nJust discovered Heal & Celeb and I’m obsessed! The food is 100% plant-based and seriously next level – Pho was so flavorful, the bánh xèo perfectly crispy, and the pineapple fried rice? Literally served in a real pineapple, how cute is that?! Don’t skip the spring rolls and fresh fruit either, super fresh and clean. Loved the chill vibe, free herbal tea (yes, free!), super friendly staff, and even free parking which is kinda rare in Saigon. If you’re into healthy eats or just want good food that feels good, this spot is a whole vibe. Will totally come back again!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTry more of their Vietnamese dishes everything’s packed with flavor and super fresh! And don’t miss out on their kombucha.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 3, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
