            "review_text": "Munyoz\nZurich, Switzerland486 contributions\n0\nVery good- must try Ban Xeo\nSep 2024 • Couples\nVery good spot for chilling and eating local food.\nThe best for me was Ban Xeo, very fulfilling and tasty. It is a huge portion so you might get it for 2 people.\nThis restaurant is very small so there are not too many people around and staff is very discreet. \nThe only thing I think they should improve is the drinks, which are pricey compare to the food and probably not their strong point of selling, but if you go there try for sure the Ban-xeo.\nRead more\nWritten September 27, 2024",
